Sanjay Ramasamy’s life shattered after a traumatic incident that left him with severe short-term memory loss. Since then, his days reset without warning, forcing him to rely on written reminders to survive.
He writes everything down—dates, passwords, clues—on walls and inside files, turning his surroundings into a map of his fractured memory.
Sanjay once trusted someone close to him—someone who uncovered the darker side of Caesar. Before the truth could fully come out, that person was silenced."KEY 3" Kalpana, the girl closest to Sanjay, was killed, and the shock of that loss broke his mind.
